Third-party material compiled into DeckPilot
--------------------------------------------

Key font (crates/deckpilot-render): the 8 x 8 bitmap glyphs for ASCII and
Latin-1 Supplement come from the font8x8 crate, version 0.3
(https://crates.io/crates/font8x8), MIT License, Copyright (c) 2017
Joaquin Rosales; its glyph data is based on Daniel Hepper's font8x8
(https://github.com/dhepper/font8x8), public domain, which derives from
public domain VGA fonts. The Latin Extended-A glyphs are composed by
DeckPilot from those glyphs and diacritics drawn in DeckPilot's own code.

